Büyük satış öncesi &quot;Daily Imb&quot; yazan bölgelerin öneminden bahsedip alım potansiyeli arayacağımı söylemiştim.
Bu 2 bölgenin önemi devam ediyor.

Üstteki Daily Imb yazan bölgenin kazanımı sonrası yeni dirençler kırmızı kutulu bölge ($2.75’ler) ve oranın da kazanımı</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto relative overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1.856497175141243"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1988282830346932546/photo/1"><img alt="" class="w-full" loading="lazy" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5fMjrZWYAIO5Pi?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5fMjrZWYAIO5Pi?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5fMjrZWYAIO5Pi?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5fMjrZWYAIO5Pi?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/1988282830346932546/photo/1"></a></div></div></article></div><div class="shrink flex items-center text-gray-700 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:content-[&#x27;·&#x27;] [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:px-1 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:shrink-0"><span class="contents"><a id="_R_d8uipid4j6_" data-state="closed" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-body font-normal hover:underline inline-flex w-fit" href="/Efloud/status/1991989266436489225">9:57 PM · Nov 21, 2025</a><script nonce="MyoYRk0e0hnArEKDMfrV1Q==">!function(options){var element=document.getElementById(options.targetId);if(!element)return;var cached=document.querySelector('[data-timezone]');var timeZone=cached&&cached.dataset.timezone||Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions